{"defaultLocale":"zh-CN","id":"Mouseww.Prometheus","installers":[{"architecture":"x64","dependencies":[],"id":"x64-user-nullsoft","installationMetadata":{"DefaultInstallLocation":"%LocalAppData%\\Prometheus"},"priority":1,"scope":"user","sha256":"c2eeb0ec4f2a12accaf2610b8e5d680930a920b5ceb6434c8b68e2d417a02058","successCodes":[],"type":"nullsoft","uninstall":{"type":"registryKey","value":"Prometheus"},"url":"https://github.com/Mouseww/Prometheus/releases/download/v0.29.0/Prometheus_0.29.0_x64-setup.exe"},{"appsAndFeaturesEntries":[{"UpgradeCode":"{585FD20A-B31F-5AE5-AA54-FF9804385120}"}],"architecture":"x64","dependencies":[],"elevation":{"requirement":"elevationRequired","source":"inferred"},"id":"x64-machine-wix","installationMetadata":{"DefaultInstallLocation":"%ProgramFiles%\\Prometheus"},"installerSwitches":{"InstallLocation":"INSTALLDIR=\"<INSTALLPATH>\""},"priority":2,"scope":"machine","sha256":"42b99f214b96b6d4b2f10cfb3e543578cde592a4e7118177545da40867222da6","silent":{"arguments":"/quiet /norestart","source":"default"},"successCodes":[],"type":"wix","uninstall":{"type":"productCode","value":"{B6F4C905-AB62-49CC-BF1B-07A4C5F80A3C}"},"url":"https://github.com/Mouseww/Prometheus/releases/download/v0.29.0/Prometheus_0.29.0_x64_en-US.msi"}],"licenseUrl":"https://github.com/Mouseww/Prometheus/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","packageLocalizations":{"en-US":{"description":"An open-source, fork-friendly AI agent workbench.","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"Running and deploying","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/Mouseww/Prometheus/blob/HEAD/docs/en/deployment.md"},{"DocumentLabel":"Prometheus Architecture","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/Mouseww/Prometheus/blob/HEAD/docs/en/architecture.md"}],"license":"Freeware","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"An open-source, fork-friendly AI agent workbench: one kernel, four entry points — terminal / desktop / web / Android.\nTUI, desktop GUI (Tauri), web and Android share the same server and the same wire protocol, so a session continues anywhere. Gateways, knowledge bases, tools, commands, HTTP routes and UI panels are all contributed through definePlugin — even the built-in features are plugins.","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","chatbot","code","coding","large-language-model","llm","programming"]},"zh-CN":{"author":"Mouseww","copyright":"Copyright (c) 2026 Mouseww","description":"源码公开、可二次开发的 AI Agent 工作台：终端 / 桌面 / Web / 安卓四种入口。","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"运行与部署","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/Mouseww/Prometheus/blob/HEAD/docs/deployment.md"},{"DocumentLabel":"Prometheus 架构设计","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/Mouseww/Prometheus/blob/HEAD/docs/architecture.md"}],"license":"免费软件","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/Mouseww/Prometheus/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Prometheus 是一个源码公开、可二次开发的 AI Agent 工作台：同一个内核，终端 / 桌面 / Web / 安卓四种入口。\nTUI、桌面 GUI（Tauri）、Web、安卓共用同一套服务端与协议，会话随处可续。网关、知识库、工具、命令、HTTP 路由、UI 面板全部通过 definePlugin 贡献，连内置功能也是插件。","name":"Prometheus","packageUrl":"https://github.com/Mouseww/Prometheus","publisher":"prometheus","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/Mouseww/Prometheus/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/Mouseww","releaseNotes":"新增\n- 流程支持循环：不需要新的循环节点，让「条件」节点的一条分支连回前面的步骤，另一条分支连到循环外作为出口\n  - 条件满足时，从回连的步骤起把循环体重新跑一遍，上一轮的输出通过 {{prev}} 和 {{节点 ID}} 带过去，直到条件不再满足才继续往下走\n  - 同一步骤最多完成 20 次，超过会报错终止，避免死循环\n  - 保存时检查：环里没有条件节点、或条件没有通向循环外的出口，会标出具体节点\n  - 画布上回边画成向上的虚线弧，循环过的步骤显示 × 次数\n- 步骤报错后可以继续：失败的运行实例不再直接作废，可以在同一个实例上「重试失败步骤」或「跳过并继续」\n  - 取消、应用关闭而中断的实例同样可以继续，被打断的那一步会重做\n  - 入口在画布进度条、运行实例列表，对话里的 flow_run 也可以传 runId 续跑\n- 每次运行是一个独立的运行实例：带独立 id，并记下启动时的流程图\n  - 「运行记录」改为「运行实例」，每行显示 id、状态、循环次数，点开即可在画布上查看该次运行的进度\n  - 流程之后改过，也能按当时的图回看\n改进\n- 新对话页的草稿按工作区分开保存：在一个项目里写的内容不会出现在另一个项目的输入框里；发送后不再留下已发出的文字\n- 流程的自动排版会忽略回边，带循环的流程不会被挤成一列\n说明\n- 旧的运行记录没有保存当时的流程图，继续运行时使用当前的流程定义\n- 运行实例仍保留最近 60 条\n- 若你用的是桌面安装版，需要更新到本版本才生效；源码运行的话重新构建前端与服务端即可","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/Mouseww/Prometheus/releases/tag/v0.29.0","tags":["人工智能","代码","大模型","大语言模型","智能体","编程","聊天机器人","自主智能"]}},"publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/Mouseww/Prometheus/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/Mouseww","releaseDate":"2026-11-05","releaseDateSource":"commit","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/Mouseww/Prometheus/releases/tag/v0.29.0","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"8ab5b6a34a787eee24b0430c2fbd72515bd43638","manifestVersion":"1.28.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/m/Mouseww/Prometheus/0.29.0/Mouseww.Prometheus.installer.yaml","sha256":"445f6ccaf31ca48065681633d1eeb64432139f603ee7bb164377b218ef1bbf6b"},{"path":"manifests/m/Mouseww/Prometheus/0.29.0/Mouseww.Prometheus.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"75524a34c80b57e8767b0056fa33556e22a731f5d5417b88eba92b3525bade23"},{"path":"manifests/m/Mouseww/Prometheus/0.29.0/Mouseww.Prometheus.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"52fbaccdbd26ee427f59bfcd48371dbc2cc0bb00939768a849afb85b3c86c820"},{"path":"manifests/m/Mouseww/Prometheus/0.29.0/Mouseww.Prometheus.yaml","sha256":"28ff35d4e4c019900ad841e3482ddf60185356552bb2fc1768d7421fa98cffa9"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.29.0"}